Below is a clean, responsive HTML5 starter template for Obora Travel Agency that you can copy and save into your file.
html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Obora Travel Agency | Explore Ethiopia & Beyond</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
    }
    header {
      background: #0f4c5c;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem 5%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 76, 92, 0.75), rgba(15, 76, 92, 0.75)), #1e6091;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e36414;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 3rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: #0f4c5c;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #0f4c5c;
    }
    .contact-form {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.6rem;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    footer {
      background: #0f4c5c;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Obora Travel Agency</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#destinations">Destinations</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h2>Your Journey Starts With Obora</h2>
    <p>Reliable flight bookings, custom tour packages, and seamless travel planning tailored to your needs.</p>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Book Your Trip</a>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Services</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Flight Reservations</h3>
        <p>Domestic and international flight ticketing at competitive rates with flexible booking options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Tour Packages</h3>
        <p>Guided cultural, historical, and nature tours designed for solo travelers, families, and groups.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Hotel & Visa Support</h3>
        <p>Hassle-free hotel accommodations and travel documentation assistance from start to finish.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="destinations" class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Popular Destinations</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Lalibela & Historical North</h3>
        <p>Discover ancient rock-hewn churches and centuries of rich Ethiopian heritage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Bale Mountains & South</h3>
        <p>Experience breathtaking highlands, endemic wildlife, and vibrant cultural traditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>International Getaways</h3>
        <p>Curated holiday and business trips to Dubai, Nairobi, Istanbul, and major global hubs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Plan Your Next Trip</h2>
    <form class="contact-form">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="name">Full Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email Address</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="details">Trip Details</label>
        <textarea id="details" rows="4" placeholder="Destination, travel dates, and number of travelers"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn" style="border: none; cursor: pointer; width: 100%;">Send Inquiry</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Obora Travel Agency. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
Use code with caution.

Key Features Included

• Responsive Layout: Adapts automatically to mobile phones, tablets, and desktop screens.
• Core Sections: Includes a navigation bar, hero banner, services grid, destination highlights, and a booking inquiry form.
• Single-File Setup: Uses embedded CSS so you can open and preview it immediately in any browser without needing extra files.
